<title>GERMANY: Nude animal fans, in Santa hats, protest in Berlin.</title>
<headline>Nude animal fans, in Santa hats, protest in Berlin.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Naked anti-fur activists, wearing only Santa Claus-style hats, braved freezing temperatures to protest in Berlin's main shopping street on Saturday.</p>
<p>Some 20 naked men and women walked down the Kurfuerstendamm with a huge banner reading &quot;Better naked than with fur&quot; covering some of their modesty.</p>
</text>
